  "solution": "Given equation:- 14 * 11 * 97 * 67 * 10\n\nInterchanging * with signs\n\n**Option(1)** +, −, =, ×\n\n⇒ __**14 + 11**__- 97 =__** 67 × 10**__\n\n⇒ __**25 - 97**__ = 670\n\n⇒ -72 ≠ 670\n\n**LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option(2)** ×, −, =, +\n\n⇒ __**14 × 11**__ - 97 = 67 + 10\n\n⇒ __**154 - 97 **__= 77\n\n⇒ 57 ≠ 77\n\n**LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option(3)** ×, −, =, −\n\n⇒ __**14 × 11 **__- 97 = 67 -10\n\n⇒ __**154 - 97 **__= 57\n\n⇒ 57 = 57\n\n**LHS = RHS**\n\n**Option(4)** +, =, −, ×\n\n⇒ __**14 + 11 **__=97 - __**67 × 10**__\n\n⇒ 25 = __**97 - 670**__\n\n⇒ 25 ≠ - 573\n\n**LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nTherefore, only option(3) satisfies the above equation\n\nHence, the correct answer is** option(3)**",
